// tests/fixtures/decision-corpus.ts
// A seed corpus of how people actually phrase decisions, with the kind each SHOULD resolve to.
//   null  = "no confident guess" — the classifier must stay silent and leave it to the planner / the generic `other` slots.
// Grow this from real data (docs/DECISION_TAXONOMY.md has the query), not from imagination: every row added from a
// production `other` session is one more decision type the taxonomy provably covers.
